      "summary_sent_score": 0.20429040491580963
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 13,
      "text": "It is asserted in the FIR that the informant received an information that contraband articles namely, Gutka, Pan Masala,\nscented beetle nuts, etc., were being transported in a vehicle.",
